{
  "slug": "product-discovery",
  "name": "Product Discovery",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Run a product initiative as a tracked journey — not a toolbox of one-shot answers. Persistent state across sessions: living PRD, evidence-typed hypotheses (REAL/SYNTHETIC/INFERRED), decision log. From one-sentence problem to PRD, AB test analysis, and GTM rollout to existing users — 19 configurable steps.\n\nKey features:\n• One-sentence start — describe your problem, get hypotheses + research plan in 60 seconds\n• 19-step pipeline across 3 phases: Problem Research → Solution Design + Validation → Launch\n• Living PRD that builds incrementally as you progress\n• Evidence typing (REAL/SYNTHETIC/INFERRED with confidence 0.0-1.0)\n• Cross-session continuity — resume exactly where you stopped\n• Personal context that grows: pm-profile.md, .product-corrections.md, .initiatives-digest.md\n• Tracker integration: push tickets to Jira /Linear / GitHub Issues via MCP\n• 5 pipeline templates: Quick / Full / Problem-only / Solution-only / Custom\n\nFor PMs working on a real initiative who want a structured path from problem to launch — not just one-shot AI answers.\n\nRequires Claude Code desktop or CLI (web version not supported — needs persistent local state).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `init` (Scaffold the Product Discovery pipeline into the user's current project directory).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install product-discovery@claude-community` from `lenar-amirov/product-pipeline-public`.\n\nRun a product initiative as a tracked journey — from one-sentence problem to PRD, with persistent state across sessions.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
